### Gateway health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Restaurant — oluştur
# @name createRestaurant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Adana Sofrası",
  "address": "Caferağa Mah. Kadıköy / İstanbul",
  "cuisine": "Türk",
  "open": true
}

### Restaurant — liste
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants

### Customer — oluştur
# @name createCustomer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ali Veli",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "phone": "5551112233"
}

### Customer — adres ekle
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.id}}/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ev",
  "street": "Caferağa",
  "city": "İstanbul"
}

### Order — CRUD (saga yok)
# @name createOrder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}",
  "totalAmount": 149.90,
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### Saga — Sipariş Ver (mutlu yol)
# @name sagaHappy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}",
  "totalAmount": 149.90,
  "forceRestaurantAccept": true
}

### Saga — sipariş durumu (1-3 sn sonra CONFIRMED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{sagaHappy.response.body.id}}

### Saga — Sipariş Ver (restoran red / compensate)
# @name sagaReject
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "restaurantId": "{{createRestaurant.response.body.id}}",
  "totalAmount": 89.50,
  "forceRestaurantReject": true
}

### Saga — red sonucu (CANCELLED + cancelReason)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{sagaReject.response.body.id}}

### Payment — oluştur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{createOrder.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 149.90
}

### Delivery — kurye ata
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{createOrder.response.body.id}}",
  "courierName": "Ahmet"
}

### Notification — mock SMS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "5551112233",
  "channel": "SMS",
  "message": "Siparis alindi"
}

### Hata — 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
